                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's more of an arcade experience than a full fledged game. \nThere are two stages atm with a third that says coming soon but considering there have been zero updates I highly doubt it. You basically wag your hand back and forth and mow down waves of guys. After a short horse ride you then fight the boss. \nOne stage has dumpling power ups you marginally steer your horse towards. The other stage has none.  \nThere are two difficulty levels. The easy one you can't die, but you can fail the boss fight if you run out of time.  The hard mode you have a health bar and can die.\nThere are also some locked weapons that also say coming soon.\nThe good thing is that it ran smooth for me with no slowdown for all those characters on screen. (1080ti i7)\n\nI picked it up to get a taste of DW in vr but price vs content = thumbs down",
